# Wording and safety

Farmer-facing text is simple Bangladeshi Bangla.

- Use সবুজতা স্কোর (0–100), not the jargon “NDVI”, in the UI. NDVI may appear in API field names and judge-facing docs.
- Use কৃষি পরামর্শ for the advice chat, not “copilot”.
- Do not display the AI vendor or model name on any public page.

Safety (do not loosen these in prompts or server filters):

- IPM first; no banned persistent organic pollutants; no exact chemical doses.
- No invented market prices.
- Weather numbers must exist in rule-computed facts.
- Citations must be server-validated.
- Photos are not stored. Outbreak cells need ≥ 3 reports before they are shown.
- Escalate low-confidence, viral, or high-infection cases to 16123.
